WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.586 --> 00:00:12.567
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Can I help you?

2
00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:16.174
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, what size is this shirt?

3
00:00:23.605 --> 00:00:24.770
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Let’s see.

4
00:00:27.281 --> 00:00:30.317
It’s a small. What size do you need?

5
00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.235
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> A medium.

6
00:00:39.609 --> 00:00:43.695
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Just a moment. This is a medium.

7
00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:49.128
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you. Can I try it on?

8
00:00:56.662 --> 00:01:00.109
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> Of course. The changing rooms are over there.

9
00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:02.483
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.

10
00:01:09.949 --> 00:01:11.021
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> How is it?

11
00:01:11.158 --> 00:01:12.368
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s great.

12
00:01:19.651 --> 00:01:21.979
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> It’s a very nice shirt.

13
00:01:22.253 --> 00:01:23.441
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> How much is it?

14
00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.709
<v><b>Shop assistant:</b></v> It’s forty-four ninety-nine.

15
00:01:32.846 --> 00:01:35.038
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Great. Thank you.